---
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

interface Props {
  translations: any;
}

const { translations } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="how-to-install" class="install-section">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="install-heading scroll-animate">
      <span class="install-kicker" data-i18n="install.label">Guía de instalación</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="install.title">Instala Bolsía en unos minutos</h2>
      <p data-i18n="install.description">Sigue estos pasos para instalar Bolsía en tu dispositivo Android.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-steps">
      <article class="install-step-card scroll-animate">
        <span class="install-number">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.step1.title">Descarga el APK</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.step1.description">Pulsa el botón de descarga para obtener el archivo APK en tu dispositivo.</p>
          <div class="install-meta"><span data-i18n="install.step1.file">Archivo: Bolsia.apk</span><span>{siteConfig.download.size}</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="install-step-card scroll-animate delay-100">
        <span class="install-number">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.step2.title">Permite instalaciones externas</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.step2.description">Android necesita permiso para instalar una aplicación que no viene de Play Store.</p>
          <ol class="install-instructions">
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.0.text">Ve a</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.0.label">Configuración</strong>.</li>
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.1.text">Toca</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.1.label">Seguridad</strong> <span data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.2.text">o</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.2.label">Privacidad</strong>.</li>
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.3.text">Busca y activa</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step2.instructions.3.label">Fuentes desconocidas</strong>.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="install-step-card scroll-animate delay-200">
        <span class="install-number">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.step3.title">Instala el APK</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.step3.description">Busca el archivo descargado y confirma la instalación.</p>
          <ol class="install-instructions">
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.0.text">Abre tu carpeta de</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.0.label">Descargas</strong>.</li>
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.1.text">Toca</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.1.label">Bolsia.apk</strong>.</li>
            <li><span data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.2.text">Toca</span> <strong data-i18n="install.step3.instructions.2.label">Instalar</strong>.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="install-step-card install-step-card--ready scroll-animate delay-300">
        <span class="install-number">04</span>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.step4.title">Abre y empieza</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.step4.description">Cuando termine, toca “Abrir” o busca Bolsía en tus aplicaciones.</p>
          <p class="install-ready" data-i18n="install.step4.ready">¡Todo listo para controlar tus gastos!</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <aside class="install-security scroll-animate delay-400">
      <strong data-i18n="install.securityNote.title">Nota de seguridad importante</strong>
      <p data-i18n="install.securityNote.description">Bolsía requiere el permiso de “Fuentes desconocidas” para instalarse. Tus datos se quedan en tu dispositivo y no recolectamos información personal.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .install-section {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background: #12211b;
    color: #f3faef;
  }

  .install-heading {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .install-kicker {
    color: #d7f56a;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .install-heading h2 {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  .install-heading p,
  .install-step-card p {
    color: #b7c8bd;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .install-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .install-step-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    min-height: 15rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(215, 245, 106, 0.2);
    background: #1b3028;
  }

  .install-step-card--ready {
    background: #d7f56a;
    color: #17231d;
  }

  .install-step-card--ready p {
    color: #52635a;
  }

  .install-number {
    color: #d7f56a;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .install-step-card--ready .install-number {
    color: #1d7a4c;
  }

  .install-step-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .install-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: #d7f56a;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .install-instructions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: #d7e6dc;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .install-instructions strong {
    color: #d7f56a;
  }

  .install-ready {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: #1d7a4c !important;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .install-security {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #d7f56a;
    background: #1b3028;
  }

  .install-security strong {
    color: #d7f56a;
  }

  .install-security p {
    color: #b7c8bd;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .install-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .install-steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .install-security {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
